{
  "$comment": [
    "Permission profile for the unattended solo-sweep lane (scripts/solo-sweep).",
    "",
    "This is an ALLOWLIST, not a denylist, and that is the whole design.",
    "A denylist was tried first and reviewed by two independent models; both",
    "broke it in minutes. Verified bypasses of the denylist version:",
    "  - /usr/bin/git ... ran while Bash(git config:*) was denied (argv[0] is",
    "    not canonicalised, so every deny entry was one path prefix from inert)",
    "  - python3 -c \"open(p,'w').write(...)\" wrote through an Edit() deny",
    "  - scripts/pr-babysit merges and closes PRs in one allowed command",
    "  - bd update <id> --status closed closes an issue without `bd close`",
    "  - codex exec -s workspace-write spawns a second runtime with no profile",
    "Denylists enumerate what you thought of. This lane runs unattended for a",
    "week, so it must instead enumerate what it needs.",
    "",
    "Loaded with `--permission-mode default`, under which anything not matched",
    "here requires approval, and headless has nobody to approve: it is denied.",
    "Every write the lane is allowed to make goes through scripts/solo-bd,",
    "which validates it. Nothing here can publish, merge, close, or commit.",
    "",
    "Only loaded via `claude --settings`; inert in normal sessions."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(gh pr view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr diff:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr checks:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue view:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue list:*)",
      "Bash(gh search:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git grep:*)",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(bd show:*)",
      "Bash(bd list:*)",
      "Bash(bd ready:*)",
      "Bash(bd blocked:*)",
      "Bash(bd dep list:*)",
      "Bash(bd stats:*)",
      "Bash(bd memories:*)",
      "Bash(scripts/solo-bd:*)",
      "Bash(rg:*)",
      "Bash(jq:*)",
      "Bash(wc:*)",
      "Bash(sort:*)",
      "Bash(uniq:*)",
      "Bash(head:*)",
      "Bash(tail:*)",
      "Edit(//var/home/matt/dev/mybd/reports/**)",
      "Edit(/home/matt/dev/mybd/reports/**)",
      "Bash(scripts/solo-recon:*)",
      "Bash(scripts/agent-sig.sh:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
